        "label": "information",
        "value": "The principle of the Sunilus io is to motorize standard awning with the io-Homecontrol protocol\\n80% of life time between -10°C to +40°C\\n20% of life time between -20°C to +70°C\\nStandard motor with an integrated io-homecontrol® receiver\\nDedicated for awning without mechanical blocking in the upper end limit\\nManual setting of both end limits\\nComplet range in Ø 50 and Ø 60\\nScreen or awning profile integrated:\\n-Till 20 Nm = screen\\n- From 25 Nm = awning\\nSame settings for the end limits as the Altus RTS motors\\nMy position adjustable\\nSettings can also be done with the Set&Go io\\nCompatible with all our io-homecontrol® transmitters"
