        "value": "Tubular motor 230 V/50 Hz, with built-in high-frequency receiver. Reception range: 20 metres through 2 concrete walls. Perfect closure of the awning (fabric stretch compensation) with a reduction in torque and immediate interruption of the power supply. Adjust easily by remote using remote control transmitter. Adjustable automatic intermediate position is possible. Cannot be used with relay box, standard switches and standard controls. The Orea 50 series fits in a tube with a minimum internal diameter of 47 mm, on the Orea 60, the diameter is 60 mm. Supplied as standard with a black 3-core (RRF) cable, length 3 m. Axial and radial cable ports. Not suitable for continuous use. 1 Orea RTS tubular motor can be operated wirelessly with up to 12 wireless controls and up to 3 RTS sensors. Limit switch capacity: operating time restricted to 3 min."
