        "value": "Remote control of the position of your awning: check whether your order has been executed or in which position your awning is located. Adjustable intermediate position: ideal to manage light incursion quickly and easily. Automatic calibration of the end limits: always a perfectly opened or closed awning. Compatible with all sun and wind functions: for the best control and greatest ease of use. No tension on the fabric or on the cords: your awning looks good longer. The perfect closure of the cassette: the fabric is always perfectly protected. Fabric stretching compensation: always a perfectly open or closed awning. Back impulse: always a perfectly stretched cloth."
