        "label": "B2B long description",
        "value": "Tubular motor 230 V/50 Hz with RS485 connection. Applicable in roller blinds, folding curtains, projection screens and screens. The LT50 RS485 fits in a tube with a minimum inside diameter of 47 mm. Capacity of the end adjustment on the LT50 RS485 motor: 300 revolutions but limited to a runtime of up to 3 minutes. Supplied as standard with a white VVF or black RRF 3-core power cable, length 3 m. Can be used with all RS485 controllers. Easy integration thanks to exchangeable power cable and exchangeable data cable Easy installation thanks to the HiPro advantages Quick adjustment via the RS485 setting tool Setting or adjusting the end points Adjusting the direction of rotation Resetting the motor settings Visual feedback through the application of each step of the adjustment Enjoy the RS485 feedback benefits Each motor is individually addressable Perfect alignment possible via an RS485 control Different intermediate positions can be set Feedback from the motor position Equipped with a white data cable RJ9-RJ45 with length 2 m The data cable may be a maximum of 10 m for standard cable and 20 m for a twisted cable. Additional information on the RS485 Setting tool can be found on page 419 in the section “Somfy for you”. Axial and radial cable outputs. Not suitable for continuous use."
